  "notes": [
    "policyCount equals the sum of layer maxPolicies (6 layers -> 1077); minPolicies is 0 everywhere, so the allocation is fixed by maxPolicies alone.",
    "Two-layer execution: 24 depth-layer policies x 30 + 1053 coverage-layer policies x 1 = 1773 executions.",
    "Strata are keyed by logical form only. Whitelist size is drawn once per policy from the global buckets (see createPolicyBlueprint), so setSize does not track predicateCount.",
    "Profile terms (GRU, HMB, NMDS, GSO, NCU) share predicate slot 10; combos that include them raise the term count and nesting depth without raising predicateCount.",
    "Remaining dependencies are syntactic, not design choices: k=1 <=> trivial <=> flat; >=4 ontology-bound terms => deep; and_or_mixed => k>=3; setSize none <=> profile-only <=> predicateCount single.",
    "Structure is classified as in the SPP data generator: logicStructure on the author-level expression, nestingDepth/predicateCount on the normalized expression, setSize on whitelistSize.",
    "Validate offline with: npm run unified:validate"
  ],
